    },
    {
      "angle": 0,
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 1,
      "roughness": 0,
      "opacity": 100,
      "seed": 80222,
      "version": 1,
      "versionNonce": 90222,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "id": "mechanisms-t",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 884,
      "y": 254,
      "width": 322,
      "height": 542,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "text": "Isolation Mechanisms\n\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\n\n1. Namespace (K8s)\n   each project in own ns\n   NetworkPolicy denies cross-ns\n\n2. Database\n   separate CNPG cluster per project\n   no shared state\n\n3. Credentials\n   vault path scoped by org/project\n   PAT authorization\n\n4. JWT claims\n   token bound to {orgSlug}/{project}\n   rejected for other projects\n\n5. RLS (row level)\n   request.user_id set per query\n   CREATE POLICY enforces scope\n\n6. Org membership\n   user must be org member\n   checked on every request",
      "fontSize": 11,
      "fontFamily": 2,
      "textAlign": "center",
      "verticalAlign": "middle",
      "containerId": "mechanisms",
      "originalText": "Isolation Mechanisms\n\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\n\n1. Namespace (K8s)\n   each project in own ns\n   NetworkPolicy denies cross-ns\n\n2. Database\n   separate CNPG cluster per project\n   no shared state\n\n3. Credentials\n   vault path scoped by org/project\n   PAT authorization\n\n4. JWT claims\n   token bound to {orgSlug}/{project}\n   rejected for other projects\n\n5. RLS (row level)\n   request.user_id set per query\n   CREATE POLICY enforces scope\n\n6. Org membership\n   user must be org member\n   checked on every request",
      "lineHeight": 1.35
    },
    {
      "angle": 0,
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "roughness": 0,
